<title>USA: Eveleth-Gilbert PS ISD 2154, Minn., won by Piper.</title>
<headline>Eveleth-Gilbert PS ISD 2154, Minn., won by Piper.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray, Inc., said it won $3.600</p>
<p>million of Eveleth-Gilbert Public Schools ISD 2154, Minn., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.402 percent.</p>
</text>
